5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to begin this process with you all. To ensure our reporting remains transparent and manageable, I will look into independent checks on holdings' reported figures and appraisal needs at the last audit.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
